      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A light reaches every surface within its Range and its cone. A wall blocks it only by casting a shadow, so the light's Shadow Type must not be No Shadows. Without shadows, light passes through every surface.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Kiosk Light is a Spot Light inside the kiosk. It is off, and its Shadow Type is No Shadows. You switch it on: what does it light outside?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Kiosk Light (Station 4 \u203A Kiosk \u203A Inside) and tick the Light component on.\n2. Look at the floor outside the kiosk.\n3. Set Shadow Type to Soft Shadows and look again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 26, 29</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
