  m_text: 'Shadows are drawn only up to the Max Distance in the URP Asset (Shadows section), 50 m in this project. It is measured from the camera. Beyond it, lights still light, but nothing casts a shadow.


    <b>Predict:</b> The 11 lamps all cast shadows and stand 10 m apart. Seen from this camera, which posts will show a shadow?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Look through this station''s camera: the posts are numbered 01 to 11.

    2. Select Assets/Settings/PC_RPAsset and set Max Distance to 120; compare the near and the far posts.

    3. Set it back to 50: the asset is shared by the whole project.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 20, 22, 25</color></size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
