  m_text: "Read the light in the reference first: list every source, where it is, its colour and what it lights. Then compare with the scene. Window \u203A Rendering \u203A Light Explorer lists every light with its type, colour, intensity and shadows.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Which light in reference 29 lights the figure and the ground around the pole?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. List every light source in reference 29: where it is, and its colour.\n2. Compare with this corner: one source is missing (look under the sign); add it.\n3. Open Window \u203A Rendering \u203A Light Explorer and find this corner's lights.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reference 29</color></size>"
